          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The 5th Educators Programme was successfully held on December 9-13, 2019. 30 participated in this programme from across the country including one from Qatar and one from Iran. "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Till now 83 experts from the fields of medicine, nursing, education and administrators from across the world have been trained in this programme. It provides simulation experiences and develops skills to propagate simulation based education within curricula. "
            },
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
